{"id":"W888f5ced904ade95ee7dfdf5","zh":"","en":"track irregularity power spectrum density","name":"track irregularity power spectrum density","language":"en","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C29a03110e5c943779ce2","families":[],"definition_zh":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W888f5ced904ade95ee7dfdf5","text":"track irregularity power spectrum density","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3b3145937ad6b901ce5c","source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"目前,对于青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱的系统研究还较少,轨道不平顺谱(track irregularity power spectrum density,PSD) 既是轮轨系统之激励输入,也是线路基础结构几何状态的重要表征,在车辆-轨道耦合动力学分析与评估、机车车辆悬挂参数及线桥隧设计中十分重要。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"描述轨道几何不平顺在不同空间频率上的强度分布。","language":"zh","source_id":"P106","paper_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wa5579c588ce0de1239d2fb00","name":"轨道不平顺谱","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wa5579c588ce0de1239d2fb00","name":"轨道不平顺谱","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wa5579c588ce0de1239d2fb00","name":"轨道不平顺谱","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_so